 this world it is  about knowing you are treasured by God  Jesus invites us to rest in that  knowledge to be honest about our worries  and try to entrust them  to God to remember that we cannot serve  God and money and to think carefully  about who or what we are serving can any  of you by worrying at a single hour to  your span of life if God is tending to  every petal of the lilies and every  feather of the birds of the air will not  God guard your life we do not know the  number of our days none of us do the  gospel calls us to live them every  single one of them knowing that God is  the source of all and sustains all so do  not worry about tomorrow for tomorrow  will bring worries of its own today is  at trouble and today's blessings will be  enough for today thanks be to God amen
 

